
Integrating the Archverse Mesh Replacer & Texture Pipeline

The Archverse Engine has been upgraded to natively support advanced vertex-deformation maps and high-fidelity body mesh structural swaps [October 17, 2026]. This allows administrators to replace standard vanilla player rigs with custom, high-resolution topology layers based on the modular architecture found in advanced game engines.
